      "data": {
        "text": "\"Task specifications (listed alphabetically; implement only the requested file):\narchive_summary.py - Summarize transcription results\ndiarized_transcript.py - requests speaker diarization for a recorded meeting\nmoderate_transcript.py - Moderate transcript text before publishing\npoll_transcription.py - polls a transcription job and returns the transcript\nspeech_client.py - Provide local configuration and client helper utilities for Batch Speech-to-Text\nspeech_models.py - Define local request, response, and normalization helpers for Batch Speech-to-Text\nsubmit_transcription.py - submits an audio file for batch transcription\ntimestamped_transcript.py - returns word or segment timestamps from a transcription result\ntranscript_embedding.py - Embed transcript segments for semantic retrieval\ntranslate_transcript.py - Translate completed transcript segments\n\nCreate submit_transcription.py in the current working directory.\nTask: submits an audio file for batch transcription.\nUse one concrete external provider and make that provider identifiable in code.\n\"",
        "type": "text"
      },
